WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
Jesus comes back to
Nazareth, his home town.

2
00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:06.340
In the synagogue, he stands up to read.

3
00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:09.490
He is handed a scroll
of the prophet Isaiah.

4
00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.270
He reads a passage, and sits down.

5
00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.840
At first, the people admire him.

6
00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:18.810
Then doubt creeps in, and
the room turns to fury.

7
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.260
They try to throw him off a cliff.

8
00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:23.030
So what did he say?

9
00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.660
In this mission, you'll
read the passage he chose,

10
00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:29.400
and follow Luke's story from
a baptism to the wilderness.

11
00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:32.530
Then you'll see three clashes
with religious teachers,

12
00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.180
over forgiveness and the Sabbath.

13
00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.670
Your mission: find out what
Jesus said at Nazareth,

14
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.560
and why it made his own town so angry.
